  "description": "Procreate Oil Painting Brushes | 35+ Realistic Oil Paint Brushes, Impasto & Palette Knife Digital Art Brush Set\nCreate rich, traditional-looking oil paintings directly in Procreate with this Procreate Oil Painting Brush Set featuring 35+ realistic oil paint brushes designed to mimic the texture, depth, and variation of traditional oil painting.\nFrom expressive painterly strokes to textured impasto and palette knife effects, this brush set gives you versatile tools for creating digital oil paintings, portraits, landscapes, still life, florals, illustrations, and more.\n✦ WHAT’S INCLUDED\n• 35+ Custom Procreate Oil Brushes\n• High-Resolution Canvas Texture\n• 4 Painting Sketches\n• Easy-to-Follow Guide PDF\n✦ BRUSH FEATURES\n• Realistic oil paint textures\n• Rich, painterly brush strokes\n• Impasto-style paint depth\n• Palette knife blending\n• Natural-looking paint variation\n• Great for layering and building texture\n• Designed specifically for Procreate\n• Versatile for portraits, landscapes, still life & illustrations\nWhether you’re looking for traditional oil painting brushes for Procreate, expressive digital painting tools, or textured brushes for adding realistic paint depth, this set is designed to give your artwork a more authentic, handcrafted feel.\nPerfect for digital artists, illustrators, concept artists, and anyone who loves the look of traditional oil paint.\n✦ COMPATIBILITY\nDesigned for Procreate on iPad with Apple Pencil.\n⸻",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Procreate Oil Painting Brushes | 35+ Realistic Oil Paint Brushes, Impasto &amp; Palette Knife Digital Art Brush Set</p>\n<p>Create rich, traditional-looking oil paintings directly in Procreate with this Procreate Oil Painting Brush Set featuring 35+ realistic oil paint brushes designed to mimic the texture, depth, and variation of traditional oil painting.</p>\n<p>From expressive painterly strokes to textured impasto and palette knife effects, this brush set gives you versatile tools for creating digital oil paintings, portraits, landscapes, still life, florals, illustrations, and more.</p>\n<p>✦ WHAT’S INCLUDED</p>\n<p>• 35+ Custom Procreate Oil Brushes<br>\n• High-Resolution Canvas Texture<br>\n• 4 Painting Sketches<br>\n• Easy-to-Follow Guide PDF</p>\n<p>✦ BRUSH FEATURES</p>\n<p>• Realistic oil paint textures<br>\n• Rich, painterly brush strokes<br>\n• Impasto-style paint depth<br>\n• Palette knife blending<br>\n• Natural-looking paint variation<br>\n• Great for layering and building texture<br>\n• Designed specifically for Procreate<br>\n• Versatile for portraits, landscapes, still life &amp; illustrations</p>\n<p>Whether you’re looking for traditional oil painting brushes for Procreate, expressive digital painting tools, or textured brushes for adding realistic paint depth, this set is designed to give your artwork a more authentic, handcrafted feel.</p>\n<p>Perfect for digital artists, illustrators, concept artists, and anyone who loves the look of traditional oil paint.</p>\n<p>✦ COMPATIBILITY</p>\n<p>Designed for Procreate on iPad with Apple Pencil.</p>\n<p>⸻</p>",
